{"seq":4,"slug":"soft-actor-critic","title":"Soft Actor-Critic 柔性演员-评论家算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/soft-actor-critic","wordCount":1690,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"soft-actor-critic-柔性演员-评论家算法\">Soft Actor-Critic 柔性演员-评论家算法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Soft Actor-Critic（SAC）是一种基于最大熵（Maximum Entropy）框架的离策略 Actor-Critic 算法，由 Haarnoja 等人于 2018 年提出。SAC 的核心创新在于将策略的熵（Entropy）作为额外的优化目标——智能体不仅要最大化累积奖励，还要最大化策略的随机性。这一设计看似矛盾（为什么要鼓励随机行为？），实际上带来了显著的探索效率提升、更好的鲁棒性和更平滑的优化景观。</p>\n<p>SAC 的目标函数修改为：J(π) = Σ_t E[r_t + α·H(π(·|s_t))]，其中 H(π(·|s_t)) 是策略在状态 s_t 的熵，α 是温度参数。温度参数控制了奖励最大化和熵最大化之间的权衡——α 越大，策略越倾向随机探索；α 越小，越接近标准的奖励最大化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[标准 RL 目标] --&gt; B[最大化累积奖励]&#10;    C[最大熵 RL 目标] --&gt; B&#10;    C --&gt; D[最大化策略熵]&#10;    D --&gt; E[更好的探索]&#10;    D --&gt; F[更强的鲁棒性]&#10;    D --&gt; G[多模态策略]&#10;    B --&gt; H[SAC 统一目标]&#10;    D --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[标准 RL 目标] --&gt; B[最大化累积奖励]\n    C[最大熵 RL 目标] --&gt; B\n    C --&gt; D[最大化策略熵]\n    D --&gt; E[更好的探索]\n    D --&gt; F[更强的鲁棒性]\n    D --&gt; G[多模态策略]\n    B --&gt; H[SAC 统一目标]\n    D --&gt; H</pre><p>SAC 与其他主流算法的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>PPO</th>\n<th>DDPG</th>\n<th>TD3</th>\n<th>SAC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>策略类型</td>\n<td>在策略</td>\n<td>离策略确定性</td>\n<td>离策略确定性</td>\n<td>离策略随机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动作空间</td>\n<td>离散/连续</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>连续（可扩展离散）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>探索机制</td>\n<td>策略熵</td>\n<td>动作噪声</td>\n<td>动作噪声</td>\n<td>最大熵目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本效率</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超参数敏感度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练稳定性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"最大熵强化学习\">最大熵强化学习</h2><p>最大熵强化学习的思想源于信息论和统计物理。在最大熵框架下，Bellman 方程被修改为&quot;软 Bellman 方程&quot;：</p>\n<p>软状态价值：V(s) = E_{a~π}[Q(s,a) - α·log π(a|s)]</p>\n<p>软动作价值：Q(s,a) = r + γ·E_{s&#39;}[V(s&#39;)]</p>\n<p>软策略改进产生的最优策略为：π*(a|s) ∝ exp(Q(s,a)/α)，即 Boltzmann 策略。直觉上，最大熵最优策略在所有&quot;同样好&quot;的动作上分配等概率，只在明显更好或更差的动作上偏移概率质量。</p>\n<p>最大熵方法的理论优势包括：<strong>探索性更强</strong>——策略天然保持随机性，不需要额外的探索噪声；<strong>更好的多模态捕获</strong>——当存在多个等价好的策略时，最大熵策略能保持在多个模式之间的分布，而标准 RL 可能随机坍缩到某一个；<strong>策略迁移更好</strong>——高熵策略在预训练时保留更多信息，迁移到相似任务时适应更快；<strong>优化更平滑</strong>——熵正则化使得目标函数的景观更加平滑，减少了优化中的不稳定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双-q-网络与目标网络\">双 Q 网络与目标网络</h2><p>SAC 维护五组网络参数：Actor 策略网络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、两个 Critic Q 网络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{w_1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9334em;vertical-align:-0.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{w_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9334em;vertical-align:-0.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、以及两个目标 Q 网络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{w_1&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0757em;vertical-align:-0.3924em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5257em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7416em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1885em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8448em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3115em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3924em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{w_2&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0757em;vertical-align:-0.3924em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5257em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7416em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1885em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8448em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3115em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3924em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。使用双 Q 网络是为了缓解值函数过高估计问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Actor π_θ] --&gt; B[采样动作]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Q_w1]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Q_w2]&#10;    C --&gt; E[取较小值 min]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[更新 Actor]&#10;    E --&gt; G[更新 Critic]&#10;    H[目标网络 Q_w1&#39;] --&gt; I[计算目标值]&#10;    J[目标网络 Q_w2&#39;] --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; G&#10;    subgraph 双 Q 与目标网络&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        H&#10;        J&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[Actor π_θ] --&gt; B[采样动作]\n    B --&gt; C[Q_w1]\n    B --&gt; D[Q_w2]\n    C --&gt; E[取较小值 min]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[更新 Actor]\n    E --&gt; G[更新 Critic]\n    H[目标网络 Q_w1'] --&gt; I[计算目标值]\n    J[目标网络 Q_w2'] --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; G\n    subgraph 双 Q 与目标网络\n        C\n        D\n        H\n        J\n    end</pre><p>Critic 更新使用两个 Q 网络中的较小值来计算目标：y = r + γ·(min(Q*{w1&#39;}(s&#39;,a&#39;), Q*{w2&#39;}(s&#39;,a&#39;)) - α·log π_θ(a&#39;|s&#39;))，其中 a&#39; 从当前策略采样。这种&quot;悲观估计&quot;有效防止了 Q 值的系统性高估。</p>\n<p>目标网络通过软更新（Polyak 平均）缓慢跟踪主网络：w&#39; ← τ·w + (1-τ)·w&#39;，其中 τ 通常取 0.005。这比直接使用主网络作为目标更稳定，因为目标不会随着每次梯度步而剧烈变化。</p>\n<p>Actor 的更新目标是最大化期望 Q 值同时最大化熵：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_\\theta\\; \\mathbb{E}_{a \\sim \\pi_\\theta}\\left[\\min\\big(Q_{w_1}(s, a),\\, Q_{w_2}(s, a)\\big) - \\alpha \\log \\pi_\\theta(a \\mid s)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6021em;vertical-align:-0.7521em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>使用重参数化技巧使梯度可以通过采样的动作回传到策略网络。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动温度调节\">自动温度调节</h2><p>SAC 最初版本需要手动设定温度参数 α，这在不同任务上需要大量调优。SAC v2 引入了**自动温度调节（Automatic Temperature Tuning）**机制，将 α 作为可学习参数，通过约束优化自动调整。</p>\n<p>具体做法是将温度学习形式化为一个双重优化问题：在满足最低熵约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"script\">H</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{H}(\\pi(\\cdot \\mid s)) \\ge \\bar{\\mathcal{H}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0097em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0097em;\">H</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的条件下最大化奖励。利用拉格朗日对偶，α 成为拉格朗日乘子，其更新规则为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"script\">H</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\leftarrow \\alpha - \\beta\\, \\nabla_\\alpha\\, \\mathbb{E}_{a \\sim \\pi}\\big[\\alpha\\, (-\\log \\pi(a \\mid s) - \\bar{\\mathcal{H}})\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0097em;\">H</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中目标熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"script\">H</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{\\mathcal{H}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0097em;\">H</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常设为动作空间维度的负值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>dim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\dim(\\mathcal{A})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">dim</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），意味着策略的熵应当至少与均匀分布的熵在同一数量级。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>温度参数</th>\n<th>策略行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>α 大</td>\n<td>高度随机探索</td>\n<td>训练初期/复杂环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>α 适中</td>\n<td>平衡探索与利用</td>\n<td>训练中期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>α 小</td>\n<td>接近确定性</td>\n<td>训练后期/简单任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动调节</td>\n<td>自适应</td>\n<td>通用推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自动温度调节是 SAC 实用化的关键——它使得 SAC 在不同任务上几乎不需要调超参数，这在连续控制领域是一个巨大的优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连续控制中的-sac-实践\">连续控制中的 SAC 实践</h2><p>SAC 在连续控制任务中表现卓越，已成为 MuJoCo、Isaac Gym 等连续控制基准上的标杆算法。</p>\n<p>SAC 使用 Squashed Gaussian 策略：网络输出均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 和对数标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log \\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>，采样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z \\sim \\mathcal{N}(\\mu, \\sigma^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 后通过 tanh 压缩到 [-1, 1]。对数概率需要校正 tanh 变换的雅可比行列式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mi>tanh</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log \\pi(a \\mid s) = \\log \\mathcal{N}(z \\mid \\mu, \\sigma^2) - \\sum_i \\log\\big(1 - \\tanh^2(z_i)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2485em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">tanh</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>SAC 作为离策略算法，使用经验回放缓冲区（Replay Buffer）存储历史经验。与 PPO 等在策略方法需要丢弃旧数据不同，SAC 可以反复使用历史数据，样本效率显著更高。在实践中，通常每收集一步新经验就做一步梯度更新（更新-采集比为 1:1），也可以使用更高的更新比进一步提高样本效率。</p>\n<p>SAC 对超参数的鲁棒性是其最大的实践优势。在大多数连续控制任务中，使用默认超参数（学习率 3e-4、回放缓冲区大小 1e6、批量大小 256、软更新系数 0.005）即可获得良好性能。这与 DDPG 和 TD3 需要仔细调节探索噪声形成鲜明对比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Soft Actor-Critic))&#10;    最大熵框架&#10;      熵正则化&#10;      软 Bellman 方程&#10;      探索与利用统一&#10;    算法组件&#10;      双 Q 网络&#10;      目标网络&#10;      重参数化&#10;    自动温度&#10;      拉格朗日对偶&#10;      目标熵约束&#10;      超参数鲁棒&#10;    实践优势&#10;      高样本效率&#10;      离策略学习&#10;      连续控制标杆\">mindmap\n  root((Soft Actor-Critic))\n    最大熵框架\n      熵正则化\n      软 Bellman 方程\n      探索与利用统一\n    算法组件\n      双 Q 网络\n      目标网络\n      重参数化\n    自动温度\n      拉格朗日对偶\n      目标熵约束\n      超参数鲁棒\n    实践优势\n      高样本效率\n      离策略学习\n      连续控制标杆</pre><ul>\n<li>SAC 将最大熵目标引入 Actor-Critic，在奖励最大化和策略随机性之间取得平衡</li>\n<li>最大熵框架带来更好的探索、更强的鲁棒性和更平滑的优化景观</li>\n<li>双 Q 网络和目标网络有效缓解值函数过高估计问题</li>\n<li>自动温度调节使 SAC 几乎不需要调超参数，显著降低了使用门槛</li>\n<li>SAC 作为离策略算法具有高样本效率，是连续控制领域的标杆</li>\n<li>Squashed Gaussian 策略和重参数化技巧是 SAC 处理有界连续动作空间的关键</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Soft Actor-Critic 柔性演员-评论家算法","id":"soft-actor-critic-柔性演员-评论家算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"最大熵强化学习","id":"最大熵强化学习"},{"level":2,"text":"双 Q 网络与目标网络","id":"双-q-网络与目标网络"},{"level":2,"text":"自动温度调节","id":"自动温度调节"},{"level":2,"text":"连续控制中的 SAC 实践","id":"连续控制中的-sac-实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"PPO 与 TRPO","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/ppo-and-trpo"},"next":{"title":"DQN 及其变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/deep-reinforcement-learning/dqn-and-variants"}}